    "--format",
    "json",
    "Complete this repository task: The helpers in `lib/utils.js` have been reduced to naive implementations that no longer honour\ntheir contract. Reimplement them, keeping every current export and signature:\n- `basename(path, { windows })` returns the last non-empty segment, treats a backslash as a\n  separator only when `windows` is set, and returns the last real segment when the path ends in\n  a separator;\n- `escapeLast(input, char, lastIdx)` escapes the last occurrence of `char` at or before `lastIdx`,\n  but skips an occurrence that is already escaped and continues searching leftwards;\n- `removePrefix(input, state)` strips a single leading './' and records it as `state.prefix`,\n  leaves `state` untouched when there was no prefix, and still works when `state` is omitted.\n\nThe other helpers already behave correctly and must keep doing so. The wider library must be\nunaffected, including `matchBase`, which routes through `basename`.\nWork only in the current repository. Do not push, open a PR, deploy, or access secrets.\nMake the smallest correct change and run relevant local checks."
  ],
